    "description": {
      "content": "Provides structured product catalog attributes derived from thousands of unstructured software quotes. Enables buyers to understand product breadth, available add-ons, pricing tiers, and feature comparisons across the Vendr software catalog. Formerly Blissfully, now part of Vendr's SaaS buying and management platform.\n\nContact Support:\n Name: Vendr API Support",
